      "raw": "<p>Making sure that I haven't been misreading Deflect for a while.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Deflect - R - When you would be dealt damage, you may deal damage to another nearby target equal to the amount reduced by your Armored ability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- First Question: Does Deflect deal damage equal to the amount that was dealt, or the amount stopped&nbsp;by Armored?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Second Question: If one has multiple Armored-like abilities (Powered Suit's Damage Reduction), do they all count for the amount of damage reduced by Armored?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I've been assuming that Deflect deals damage equal to the amount stopped by Armored, and that multiple Armored-like abilities stack for purposes of damage dealt by Deflect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If someone could clarify this, I would be grateful.</p>",
