      "created_at": "2019-10-11T02:21:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It calls out specifically the Armored ability and any other DR from other abilities wouldn’t apply. &nbsp; The damage you deal is equal to what was reduced by the Armored ability so at most it’s 3 damage.&nbsp;</p>",
